  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The initial material is zirconium-alloy fuel cladding with a pure elemental Cr coating.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pure Cr coatings undergo Cr–Zr interdiffusion that causes premature failure during accident-relevant high-temperature steam exposure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention is to introduce 2–5 wt% Al into the Cr coating during deposition.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 2–5 wt% Al to Cr will promote in situ formation of a dense Al2O3 barrier.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11929843::web::019::structure_and_composition_of_passivation",
        "PMC8709257::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al2O3 barrier will be continuous and adherent at the Cr-Al coating/Zr-alloy interface.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al preferentially oxidizes because of its oxygen affinity and forms stable Al2O3.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11929843::web::019::structure_and_composition_of_passivation"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The interfacial Al2O3 layer will limit diffusion of Cr into the Zr alloy and reduce Cr–Zr interdiffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduced interdiffusion will preserve coating integrity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-Al coating will provide effective protection under both normal pressurized-water and high-temperature steam conditions.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to pure Cr, the Cr-Al coating will exhibit reduced interfacial elemental transport.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to pure Cr, the Cr-Al coating will form thinner or less-developed oxide scales.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to pure Cr, the Cr-Al coating will have enhanced microstructural stability and adhesion to the Zr substrate.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis applies under pressurized subcritical-water exposure at approximately 300°C.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis applies under transient steam exposure at approximately 900°C.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tests will include extended exposure durations, although no numerical exposure time is specified.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimal Al concentration remains uncertain and requires further investigation.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8709257::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Long-term stability of the proposed Cr-Al coating under neutron irradiation remains unestablished.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed experiment compares pure-Cr and 2–5 wt% Al-alloyed Cr coatings in separate approximately 300°C water and approximately 900°C steam tests.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.design",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
